To query db (dev in this case), use something like:
```
cd /root/acclerk && source .env.dev && psql "$DATABASE_URL" -c 'SELECT COUNT(*) as invoices FROM "Invoice"; SELECT COUNT(*) as matches FROM "Match"; SELECT COUNT(*) as accounting_entries FROM "AccountingEntry";'
```

Tool for updating your plan in cursor seems broken. Prefer to just update whole plan instead of updating parts.